<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Peapod Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Peapod Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc initiated coverage of Peapod Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target price of $20.</p>
<p>-- said Peapod is &quot;ideally positioned to benefit from the emergence of online commerce and growth in interactive marketing.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said expects 150 percent compound annual revenue growth through 2000 and profitability beginning in early 1999.</p>
<p>-- Peapod, an online grocery shopping and delivery company, gained 3/8 to 12-3/8.</p>
</text>
